              %a{:href => "http://golem.ph.utexas.edu/category/2011/04/homotopy_type_theory_vi.html"}> blog post
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Many references on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+inductive+types"} higher inductive types
            mention pushout types and highlight their categorical semantics, but skip type-theoretic details, e.g.:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Univalent+Foundations+Project"}> Univalent Foundations Project
              , §6.8 of:
